        {
          "text": "Lapho ngiphuma ngiya ensimini, bheka labo ababulewe ngenkemba! futhi lapho ngingena emzini, bheka labo abaphethwe yindlala! yebo, umprofethi kanye nompristi bazulazula ezweni abangalazi.",
          "type": "text",
